{"id":8730246074,"name":"[Mobile Support] Tower Galactica","desc":"Tower Galactica has been discontinued on Roblox. The game's difficulty may vary a lot as a result of this, and future Roblox updates may cause bugs. Maybe one day it may receive a successor on a different platform, but until then, this is the end.\n\nIt isn't very easy leading an entire planet, especially one with constant outside threats. In this game, you are the monarch of a planet named Orbis. Fortunately, you have your associate, Plavo, to help you out with that. Unfortunately, tragedy is set to strike at any moment in this chaotic and unforgiving universe.\n\nTower Galactica is a tower defense game centered around a story-mode, having lots of stages and galaxies, each with their own separate enemies and maps.","path":"/game/8730246074-tower-galactica","slug":"8730246074-tower-galactica","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/4d985285999e2d15de2d3502194967781ea3d21f525e74bbd04e43662e697156.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d6a290b52cd0b0e8718ece4f28dfe32a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":5207768,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-03-06T08:57:03.823Z","creator":{"name":"Tower Galactica - Official Group","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Infinite-Cash-(Open-source)_917","_id":"621ac80693faafdb16a80868","title":"Infinite Cash (Open source)","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7890f","gameId":8730246074,"name":"[Mobile Support] Tower Galactica","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":8730246074},"features":"*not mine*\n\nmade by Ezpi#0474","tags":["Cash","Infinity"],"script":"--// Exploit Fix \\\\--\nif not pcall(function() return syn.protect_gui end) then\n    syn = {}\n    syn.protect_gui = function(A_1)\n        A_1.Parent = CoreGui\n